# Kitchen-concierge runtime state.
#
# These live under ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA} in normal operation, but a local test
# run or a misconfigured data dir can drop them in the working tree. They can
# contain an authenticated grocery session's contents — delivery address, order
# history, product-level purchase data — so they must never be committed.
.kitchen-concierge/
pending-cart.json
pending-order.json
order-session.json
household-dietary-profiles.json

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
